WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.858
Yeh aapka StudyQuest plan hai. Yeh students ki fees se alag hai.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:11.864
Apni limits aur usage dekhein. Free plan mein card nahi chahiye.

00:00:11.964 --> 00:00:17.865
Paid plan tabhi shuru hota hai jab payment gateway payment confirm kare.
